#: ../../library/aioble.rst:119
msgid "Module-level functions"
msgstr "Functies op moduleniveau"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:123
msgid ""
"Forwards to :meth:`bluetooth.BLE.config`, ensuring the BLE radio is active "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Stuurt door naar :meth:`bluetooth.BLE.config` en zorgt ervoor dat de BLE-"
"radio eerst actief is."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:126
msgid "*args*"
msgstr "*args*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:127
msgid "Optional single parameter name to query."
msgstr "Optionele naam van een enkele parameter om op te vragen."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:129
msgid "*kwargs*"
msgstr "*kwargs*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:130
msgid "Keyword arguments to set configuration values."
msgstr "Keyword-argumenten om configuratiewaarden in te stellen."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:134
msgid ""
"Deactivate the underlying BLE radio and run any registered sub-module "
"shutdown handlers. After calling this, scanners, advertisers, connections "
"and L2CAP channels are all torn down."
msgstr ""
"Deactiveer de onderliggende BLE-radio en voer eventuele geregistreerde "
"shutdown-handlers van submodules uit. Na het aanroepen hiervan worden "
"scanners, advertisers, verbindingen en L2CAP-kanalen allemaal afgebroken."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:140
msgid ""
"Returns a `scan` async context-manager / async-iterator that yields "
"`ScanResult` instances for each unique device discovered (or for each new "
"piece of advertising data from a known device)."
msgstr ""
"Retourneert een `scan` async context-manager / async-iterator die "
"`ScanResult`\\ -instanties oplevert voor elk uniek ontdekt apparaat (of voor"
" elk nieuw stuk advertising-data van een bekend apparaat)."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:144
msgid "*duration_ms*"
msgstr "*duration_ms*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:145
msgid ""
"How long to scan, in milliseconds. Pass ``0`` to scan indefinitely until the"
" context manager exits."
msgstr ""
"Hoe lang er gescand moet worden, in milliseconden. Geef ``0`` op om "
"onbeperkt te scannen totdat de context manager wordt afgesloten."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:148 ../../library/aioble.rst:166
msgid "*interval_us*"
msgstr "*interval_us*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:149
msgid "Scan interval in microseconds. Defaults to 1,280,000."
msgstr "Scaninterval in microseconden. Standaard 1.280.000."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:151
msgid "*window_us*"
msgstr "*window_us*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:152
msgid ""
"Scan window in microseconds (must be less than or equal to *interval_us*). "
"Defaults to 11,250."
msgstr ""
"Scanvenster in microseconden (moet kleiner dan of gelijk aan *interval_us* "
"zijn). Standaard 11.250."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:155
msgid "*active*"
msgstr "*active*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:156
msgid ""
"If ``True``, perform an active scan (request scan response data). Defaults "
"to ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Als ``True``\\ , voer een actieve scan uit (vraag scan-response-data aan). "
"Standaard ``False``\\ ."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:161
msgid ""
"Async coroutine that begins advertising and waits for an incoming central "
"connection. Returns a `DeviceConnection` representing the connected central,"
" or raises :class:`asyncio.TimeoutError` on timeout."
msgstr ""
"Async coroutine die begint met adverteren en wacht op een inkomende central-"
"verbinding. Retourneert een `DeviceConnection` die de verbonden central "
"voorstelt, of werpt :class:`asyncio.TimeoutError` bij een time-out."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:167
msgid "Advertising interval, in microseconds."
msgstr "Advertising-interval, in microseconden."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:169
msgid "*adv_data*"
msgstr "*adv_data*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:170
msgid ""
"Raw advertising payload. If unset, *adv_data* is built from the remaining "
"keyword arguments."
msgstr ""
"Ruwe advertising-payload. Indien niet ingesteld, wordt *adv_data* opgebouwd "
"uit de overige keyword-argumenten."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:173
msgid "*resp_data*"
msgstr "*resp_data*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:174
msgid ""
"Raw scan response payload. Auto-populated to overflow from *adv_data* if "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Ruwe scan-response-payload. Wordt automatisch gevuld om overloop uit "
"*adv_data* op te vangen indien nodig."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:177
msgid "*connectable*"
msgstr "*connectable*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:178
msgid "If ``True``, this is a connectable advertisement."
msgstr "Als ``True``\\ , is dit een verbindbare advertentie."

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:180
msgid "*limited_disc*"
msgstr "*limited_disc*"

#: ../../library/aioble.rst:181
